;; File     : SMO_GEO_0006+1 : SUMO/CASC source.
;; Domain   : Geometry
;; Problem  : Ocean mereology
;; Version  : Full SUMO axioms; +1 denotes FOF formulation 1.
;; English  : The Pacific Ocean is a proper part of the World Ocean.
;;
;; Refs     :
;; Source   : SUMO Geography.kif and full SUMO
;; Names    : SMO_GEO_0006
;;
;; Status   : Theorem
;; Comments : Uses Geography.kif's general rule for oceans.
